  // Every seeded room gets its DMG fittings — the same pass a room built through my app goes
  // through. The seed is HAND-AUTHORED, and hand-authored keeps drifted from the rule in three
  // directions at once: Bram's Rest had no furniture at all, Gauntlet Watch had keepsakes but no bed
  // (roomFurniture() returned nothing for a room the DMG says "comes with nonmagical furnishings"),
  // and Ravenhold's fittings carried gp: undefined. Patching three literals would only let the next
